      "created_at": "2015-12-30T07:13:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Atlantis always makes me nervous because of Toxic Seaweed, I can't stand the damage but I hate discarding an entire hand (I mostly play solo)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Otherwise, I've found the Freedom Tower to be really hero friendly as well as the Mobile Defense Platform, of course, I'm generally so overwhelmed keeping track of things that I don;t have a lot of time to analyse things as accurately as others do.</p>",
